<title>USA: 1st Bancorp of Vincennes Q2 Dec 31 loss.</title>
<headline>1st Bancorp of Vincennes Q2 Dec 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>VINCENNES, Ind. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.53   profit	 $6.51</p>
<p> Net    profit		376   profit	 4,582</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q2 results include a $7.3 million pretax net gain from the sale of two branch offices.</p>
<p>Current Q2 results include $548,000 gain on sale of loans vs $513,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     loss	     $0.37   profit	 $7.20</p>
<p> Net     loss		 255   profit	 5,070</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current six-month loss includes Savings Association Insurance Fund charge taken in first quarter of $1.3 million pretax.</p>
<p>Current six-month loss also includes $1.2 million gain on the sale of loans vs $996,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
